      "who": "DAD",
      "text": "Does web search help?"
    },
    {
      "who": "TEEN",
      "text": "Tools that search the web and show sources help a lot, because you can see where facts came from. But still open the links. It can misread them.",
      "board": {
        "type": "steps",
        "title": "WEB SEARCH",
        "items": [
          {
